{"id":"junta","lemma":"junta","pos":"noun","rank":1713,"glosses":["board, council, committee","joint, gasket","meeting (a gathering for a purpose)"],"ipa":"/ˈxunta/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"juntas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7e/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-junta.wav","formAudio":{"juntas":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Wikipedian-walker-juntas.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"No podemos posponer la junta.","en":"We can't postpone the meeting.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/845518","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to prune","l":"podar"},{"g":"to postpone"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Tom es el que me dijo cuando sería la junta.","en":"Tom is the one who told me when the meeting would be.","words":[null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,null,{"g":"me"},{"g":"to say","l":"decir"},{"g":"when"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / her"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"that"]]},{"text":"Trabajamos juntas como un equipo.","en":"We work together as a team.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/921376","words":[{"g":"to work","l":"trabajar"},null,{"g":"as"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"team"}]},{"text":"\"Una piedra rodante no junta musgo\" es un refrán.","en":"\"A rolling stone gathers no moss\" is a proverb.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/820146","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"stone"},{"g":"rolling"},{"g":"no / not"},null,{"g":"moss"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"proverb"}]},{"text":"No pueden vernos juntas.","en":"We can't be seen together.","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to see, to spot","l":"ver"},null]}]}